      <title>特斯拉赛博出租车设计揭秘：2025量产在即，版图扩张剑指何方？</title>
      <link>https://johhhhnny.github.io/TeslaDaily/posts/20251112-%E7%89%B9%E6%96%AF%E6%8B%89%E8%B5%9B%E5%8D%9A%E5%87%BA%E7%A7%9F%E8%BD%A6%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%E6%8F%AD%E7%A7%982025%E9%87%8F%E4%BA%A7%E5%9C%A8%E5%8D%B3%E7%89%88%E5%9B%BE%E6%89%A9%E5%BC%A0%E5%89%91%E6%8C%87%E4%BD%95%E6%96%B9/</link>
